OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fin the east at first otherwise the
OL,7,Fnight will be cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain in the west but dry elsewhere.
OL,9,FWinds brisk early evening across the
OL,10,Fcoasts, otherwise light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMost dry for the morning
OL,13,Fwith limited brighter spells best in
OL,14,Feast, but rain expected in the far
OL,15,Fwest. This rain extends to rest of the
OL,16,FProvance for the afternoon.
